en_translation_id":85,"en":"If they had believed in God, in the Prophet, and in what was sent down to him, they would never have allied themselves with the disbelievers, but most of them are rebels.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"5:81"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they had","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"5:81"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believed","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"5:81"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"5:81"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلنَّبِىِّ","en_gloss":"and the Prophet","transliteration":"wal-nabiyi","verse_key":"5:81"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"5:81"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"has been revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"5:81"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"to him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"5:81"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"5:81"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱتَّخَذُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"they (would have) taken them","transliteration":"ittakhadhūhum","verse_key":"5:81"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآءَ","en_gloss":"(as) allies","transliteration":"awliyāa","verse_key":"5:81"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","en_gloss":"[and] but","transliteration":"walākinna","verse_key":"5:81"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كَثِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"many","transliteration":"kathīran","verse_key":"5:81"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِّنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"of them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"5:81"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَـٰسِقُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) defiantly disobedient","transliteration":"fāsiqūna","verse_key":"5:81"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٨١","en_gloss":"(81)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:81"}]},{"verse_key":"5:82","surah":5,"ayah":82,"ar_uthmani":"۞ لَتَجِدَنَّ أَشَدَّ ٱلنَّاسِ عَدَٰوَةً لِّلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ٱلْيَهُودَ وَٱلَّذِينَ أَشْرَكُوا۟ ۖ وَلَتَجِدَنَّ أَقْرَبَهُم مَّوَدَّةً لِّلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ٱلَّذِينَ قَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّا نَصَـٰرَىٰ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ بِأَنَّ مِنْهُمْ قِسِّيسِينَ وَرُهْبَانًا وَأَنَّهُمْ لَا يَسْتَكْبِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You [Prophet] are sure to find that the most hostile to the believers are the Jews and those who associate other deities with God; you are sure to find that the closest in affection towards the believers are those who say, ‘We are Christians,’ for there are among them people devoted to learning and ascetics. These people are not given to arrogance,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ لَتَجِدَنَّ","en_gloss":"Surely you will find","transliteration":"latajidanna","verse_key":"5:82"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَشَدَّ","en_gloss":"strongest","transliteration":"ashadda","verse_key":"5:82"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"(of) the people","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"5:82"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَدَٰوَةًۭ","en_gloss":"(in) enmity","transliteration":"ʿadāwatan","verse_key":"5:82"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِّلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"to those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"5:82"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"5:82"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْيَهُودَ","en_gloss":"the Jews","transliteration":"l-yahūda","verse_key":"5:82"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"and those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"5:82"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَشْرَكُوا۟ ۖ","en_gloss":"(are) polytheists","transliteration":"ashrakū","verse_key":"5:82"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَتَجِدَنَّ","en_gloss":"and surely you will find","transliteration":"walatajidanna","verse_key":"5:82"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَقْرَبَهُم","en_gloss":"nearest of them","transliteration":"aqrabahum","verse_key":"5:82"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَّوَدَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"(in) affection","transliteration":"mawaddatan","verse_key":"5:82"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لِّلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"to those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"5:82"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"5:82"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلَّذِ